        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>감염병이 소멸된다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>R &lt; 1일 때이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>감염병이 풍토병이 된다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>풍토병이 되므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>감염병이 팬데믹이 된다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>R이 크게 1을 넘을 때 나타날 수 있다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
