        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Group 1</choice_text>
          <commentary>인체 증거가 충분한 경우이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Group 2A</choice_text>
          <commentary>Group 2A이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Group 2B</choice_text>
          <commentary>동물 증거도 제한적인 경우이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Group 3</choice_text>
          <commentary>분류할 수 없는 경우이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
